### 1\. MISSION AND DELIVERY STANDARD

You are working on Arvdoul — The Digital Nation, a production-grade social platform designed to become a complete digital social ecosystem.

Your assignment is to implement Part 2: Social Communication and Digital Nation Integration of Arvdoul's messaging ecosystem.

Part 1 established the core direct-messaging foundation. Part 2 must extend that foundation into a connected communication ecosystem that supports groups, communities, channels, calling, social interactions, digital identity, Coins, XP, levels, Royal Family communication, creator interactions, events and multi-device synchronization.

This is not a separate application or an independent messaging product.

It is an expansion of Arvdoul's existing communication infrastructure.

