The system must preserve the messaging foundation established in Part 1 while expanding its capabilities.

Do not rebuild Part 1. Extend, improve and integrate it.

The expected result is a mature social communication ecosystem capable of supporting real users, growing communities, meaningful interaction, digital ownership, and the distinctive Arvdoul economy.

