### 8.1 Vibe-to-message interaction

Support appropriate messaging interactions originating from a Vibe.

Depending on existing Vibes capabilities, allow:

* Replying to a Vibe through messaging.

* Reacting through the established interaction model.

* Sharing a Vibe to a direct conversation.

* Sharing a Vibe to an eligible group.

* Opening a relevant conversation from a Vibe interaction.

