### 13.3 Authorization

Royal Family access must be determined by the authoritative role and membership system.

A client must never be able to:

* Assign itself a Royal Family role.

* Change its official rank.

* Create an official Royal Family channel without authorization.

* Invite unauthorized members into protected spaces.

* Issue official announcements without permission.

* Elevate itself to administrator.

* Forge official communication.

