### 13.4 Official announcements

Support authorized announcement publishing.

Each announcement should have:

* Authorized sender.

* Authorized destination.

* Relevant content.

* Correct publication time.

* Valid visibility rules.

* Appropriate notification behavior.

Do not allow an unofficial user to impersonate an institutional announcement.

Distinguish actual official announcements from ordinary messages.

### 13.5 Royal Family privacy

Respect:

* Private membership information.

* Role-based access.

* Restricted conversations.

* Internal announcements.

* Existing user-blocking policies.

* Moderation policies.

Do not reveal private institutional communication in public search results or unrelated profile surfaces.

