### 17.3 Synchronization behavior

Support:

* Message synchronization.

* Conversation-list synchronization.

* Read-state synchronization.

* Unread-count synchronization.

* Draft synchronization where supported.

* Group membership synchronization.

* Community membership synchronization.

* Notification preference synchronization.

* Relevant call-state synchronization.

* Gift and transaction notification synchronization.

* XP and achievement synchronization.

